r/>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "To my mind, they do have an advantage over us because of their location."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It seems that we have some bilingual people that could potentially help with dealing with them.  "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Agreeing and Disagreeing "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " In English, when people give an opinion, it is important to show that you either agree or don't agree with it. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are many different ways in which we can show agreement or disagreement in English. Here are some of them: "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Agreeing</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Disagreeing</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> (That's a) good point.<br/> (That's) so true.<br/> I feel the same way.<br/> I'm sure you are right.<br/> That's my opinion too.<br/> I see what you mean.<br/> I can see your point now.<br/>\\t I don't disagree with that.</span><br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Not necessarily.<br/> (But) don't you think that \u2026 ?<br/> (But) what about \u2026 ? <br/> I don't really agree.<br/> I used to think that (way) \u2026 , but ...<br/> I'd like to agree (with you), but ...<br/> That doesn't really make sense (to me).<br/> You could say that, but \u2026</span> <br/>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">More on the word \u201cagree\u201d</span><br/> The chunk <span class=\"italic\"> \u2018agree with'</span> is used when you approve of something or think it is the appropriate thing to do. <br/> \u2192 <span class=\"italic\">Our company agrees with this new policy. </span></br/> \u2192<span class=\"italic\"><del> Our company agrees this new policy.</span></del>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Apart from using a noun, you can also use the chunk<span class=\"italic\"> \u201cagree with doing something\u201d</span>:<br/> \u2192 I don't agree with marketing this product. <br/> <span class=\"italic\"><del>\u2192 I don't agree marketing this product. </span></span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, choose a topic to discuss. It can be a favorite movie or something that happened at work. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make sure to give your opinion throughout the conversation. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make sure to also agree and disagree when necessary."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I choose a topic to discuss with a partner. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give my opinion during a conversation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I agree and disagree with statements when necessary."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Vocabulary"}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about jobs and work."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "  I can agree and disagree."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can give my opinion."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What do you say when you agree with someone?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What about when you disagree with someone? "}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attemp