"value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le09ob03re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le09ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le09ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le09ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Okay, so in order for us to implement our strategy, I need to make sure you're in the loop, Miranda.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: So do I. What else do you know about them? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Well, as I've mentioned, the Garcia partners are an e-commerce company based in the States. The company was founded 10 years ago by cousins Daniel and Margot Garcia."}, {"time": "22000", "image": "engenn6le09ob03re2img07.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: To my mind, if they're based in Miami, it doesn't mean they have an advantage over us. Would you agree with that, Janet?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Not necessarily. Their headquarters are located in Miami, Florida, but they have offices in Latin America.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I can see your point now. However, we seem to have some Spanish and Portuguese-speaking staff. Wouldn't you agree that this can give us a leg up?<br/>"}, {"time": "44800", "image": "engenn6le09ob03re2img06.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I don't disagree with that, but, as far as I know, Daniel Garcia, VP of Sales, has a workforce made up of 10 sales people, all of whom are based in Argentina and Brazil. They speak English, Spanish and Portuguese. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Hmmm. I believe this will give them a huge advantage. We've got more staff, but we've only got about 3 people who can actually speak both Spanish and Portuguese. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: That's a good point. But we need to bear in mind we have other strengths. Let's just call it a day and have Peter set up an appointment with Mr. Farmani."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}]}